    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueKrobus",
      "key": "spouseRoom_Krobus",
      "field": null,
      "source": "#$c .5#We're so physically different that it's a challenge to live together, isn't it?#$e#I hope the humidity here isn't bothersome to you. We both have to compromise in order to live together!",
      "translation": "#$c .5#Tělesně se od sebe tolik lišíme, že je pro nás společné bydlení náročné, že?#$e#Doufám, že ti zdejší vlhkost nevadí. Abychom spolu mohli žít, musíme oba přistoupit na kompromisy!",
      "sourceSHA256": "c6ee7590a6dbe534c40a8ca3823fd94f021871c0f4e525bfd42e84cc1dad6489",
      "translationSHA256": "99a7fa0043db37cf004cf07effcac0838925e7c8ffce97dc481d8e7c7ac26c36",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueKrobus",
      "key": "spring_Krobus",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's 'spring' now, isn't it? I can smell the peppery aroma of wild horseradish.",
      "translation": "Teď je ‚jaro‘, že? Cítím peprnou vůni divokého křenu.",
      "sourceSHA256": "981bec2d493c859fd4553d451c69bf376a9342b2584f20a62de2ac8c5834df8c",
      "translationSHA256": "dadf359b4e8993fad961220ceedff8b86fa1e0cc0199991d7db4bf7bfc445553",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueKrobus",
      "key": "summer_Krobus",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You call this time of year 'summer', right? The warmth and humidity is nice, but I wish it wasn't so sunny.",
      "translation": "Tomuto ročnímu období říkáš ‚léto‘, že? Teplo a vlhkost jsou příjemné, ale kéž by nebylo tolik slunce.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d6a5bb8864845806cb74bf01a9bebde912c51b0df7bb51b526aa3455aa3d5bba",
      "translationSHA256": "dde59e05ab61c84c381ab405f8187f4b925818776533f7e8306219f7f1414cc9",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueKrobus",
      "key": "fall_Krobus",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's been feeling a bit cooler lately, with a musty smell. You call this time of year 'fall', correct?",
      "translation": "Poslední dobou je trochu chladněji a cítím zatuchlý pach. Tomuto ročnímu období říkáš ‚podzim‘, správně?",
      "sourceSHA256": "88c495ef9cfbc0325d7c495b9e239b78c477804883aed32ea22b9e10a5cb0bf3",
      "translationSHA256": "c1d4e4663143b0032a44b94a027bf0e08390fa166e8c9db637387cb6a704be5f",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueKrobus",
      "key": "winter_Krobus",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The darkness this time of year is very soothing. If only it were warmer!",
      "translation": "Tma v tomto ročním období je velmi uklidňující. Kéž by jen bylo tepleji!",
